Winter 2016" height="2188" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/0xdeadbeef/6abc986d57549.jpg" width="2917"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://0xdeadbeef.some.pics"&gt;@0xdeadbeef&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 05:04:50 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>我的独立出版物 Brennan.day 新设计的品牌板，介绍了由我制作的新自定义调色板，以及 Bunny Fonts 提供的字体。</title><link>https://some.pics/6abc4d4d83229</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我的独立出版物 Brennan.day 新设计的品牌板，介绍了由我制作的新自定义调色板，以及 Bunny Fonts 提供的字体。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='Brand board for brennan.day showing two colour palettes and three typefaces. The "Sunflower" light-mode palette lists neutrals White, Cultured Pearl, Gallery, Cod Gray, Tundora, and Alto, plus accents Cardinal (red), Rock Spray (orange), Chelsea Gem (olive/gold), Jewel (green), Metallic Seaweed (teal), New Car (blue), and Electric Violet (purple), each with hex codes. The "Moonflower" dark-mode palette lists neutrals Cod Gray, Eerie Black, Eerie Black+, Concrete, Nobel, and Tundora, plus accents Shimmering Blush (pink), Porsche (orange), Gold, Emerald (green), Cyan, Malibu (light blue), and Mauve (purple), each with hex codes. 

Below, three typefaces show sample uppercase, lowercase, and numeral glyphs: Young Serif for headings and titles, Newsreader (with italic) for body text, and Public Sans (with bold) for navigation, UI, and metadata. All served by Bunny Fonts.' height="1586" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/brennan/6abc4d4d83229.png" width="1238"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://brennan.some.pics"&gt;@brennan&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 23:44:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>你们还记得可口可乐零度曾经用白色罐装的时候吗？</title><link>https://some.pics/6abc201f57e92</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你们还记得可口可乐零度曾经用白色罐装的时候吗？&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Multiple Coca-Cola Zero Sugar cans stacked together, showing the product's red and white branding and &amp;quot;zero&amp;quot; text on silver packaging." height="1920" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/mihobu/6abc201f57e92.jpg" width="2560"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://mihobu.some.pics"&gt;@mihobu&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 20:31:35 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>大峡谷的日落

这张照片是我2001年6月去亚利桑那州旅行时用奥林巴斯 C3000Z 拍的。今天我在找完全不相干的东西时偶然翻到了它。我真该把这些老照片都好好整理一遍了。</title><link>https://some.pics/6abc1ecb7372b</link><description>&lt;p&gt;大峡谷的日落

这张照片是我2001年6月去亚利桑那州旅行时用奥林巴斯 C3000Z 拍的。今天我在找完全不相干的东西时偶然翻到了它。我真该把这些老照片都好好整理一遍了。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Sunset over a canyon with a lone pine tree silhouetted against the orange sky. A person stands on a rocky outcrop in the foreground. A rainbow arcs through clouds on the left side." height="960" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/mihobu/6abc1ecb7372b.jpg" width="1280"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://mihobu.some.pics"&gt;@mihobu&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 20:25:50 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>月亮透进来。</title><link>https://some.pics/6abc19488a9e8</link><description>&lt;p&gt;月亮透进来。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="The night sky, filled with clouds. An opening in the clouds shows the moon. " height="5712" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/furstenberg/6abc19488a9e8.jpg" width="4284"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://furstenberg.some.pics"&gt;@furstenberg&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 20:02:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>今日验房风景不错</title><link>https://some.pics/6abc0da3d4c80</link><description>&lt;p&gt;今天看房的其中一处风景不错。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Sky, water, and small islands" height="5402" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/birming/6abc0da3d4c80.jpg" width="7203"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://birming.some.pics"&gt;@birming&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 19:12:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>和毛孩子共进晚餐</title><link>https://some.pics/6abbfc1f7833c</link><description>&lt;p&gt;和毛茸茸的成员共进晚餐&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A close shot of our house cat lying on the table while we are having dinner." height="3072" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/jsanz/6abbfc1f7833c.jpg" width="4096"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://jsanz.some.pics"&gt;@jsanz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 1